call FlushChildHashtable(L7,I97)
call DestroyTimer(t)
set u=null
set t=null
endfunction
//风暴双雄
function ATD takes nothing returns nothing
local unit ZX7=GetTriggerUnit()
local trigger t=null
local timer tt=null
local integer I97=0
local unit AQD=null
local integer BC7=0
local integer i=0
local item D88
local integer AUD='I02M'
local real DUR=0
if ZX7==null or GetUnitTypeId(ZX7)==0 then
set ZX7=null
return
endif
set t=CreateTrigger()
set tt=CreateTimer()
set I97=GetHandleId(t)
set AQD=CreateUnit(GetOwningPlayer(ZX7),'N0MM',GetUnitX(ZX7),GetUnitY(ZX7),0)
set BC7=GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A2M0')
set DUR=10+BC7*2
if AQD==null or GetUnitTypeId(AQD)==0 then
call FlushChildHashtable(L7,(I97))
call OZ7(t)
call DestroyTimer(tt)
set ZX7=null
set AQD=null
set t=null
set tt=null
return
endif
call DestroyEffect(AddSpecialEffectTarget("Abilities\\Spells\\Orc\\FeralSpirit\\feralspirittarget.mdl",AQD,"chest"))
if TV7(GetOwningPlayer(AQD))==false then
set AUD='I0PC'
endif
if IsPlayerAlly(GetLocalPlayer(),GetOwningPlayer(ZX7)) or IsPlayerObserver(GetLocalPlayer()) then
call SetUnitVertexColor(AQD,75,75,75,100)
endif
if Ab[GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(ZX7))]then
call SelectUnitAddForPlayer(AQD,GetOwningPlayer(ZX7))
endif
call DisableTrigger(H94)
loop
exitwhen i>5
if UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i)!=null and GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))!=ZU[X0]and GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))!=ZU[ZC]and GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))!=ZU[VC]and GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))!=ZU[WC]and GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))!=ZU[H3]and GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))!=ZU[DF4]and GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))!=ZU[EW]then
set D88=CreateItem(GetItemTypeId(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i)),0,0)
if GetItemCharges(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i))>0 then
call SetItemCharges(D88,GetItemCharges(UnitItemInSlot(ZX7,i)))
endif
call UnitAddItem(AQD,D88)
call SetItemPlayer(D88,GetOwningPlayer(AQD),false)
if GetItemTypeId(D88)==ZU[B5]or GetItemTypeId(D88)==ZU[C5]or GetItemTypeId(D88)==ZU[EW]then
call SetItemDropOnDeath(D88,false)
endif
else
call UnitAddItem(AQD,CreateItem(AUD,0,0))
endif
set i=i+1
endloop
call EnableTrigger(H94)
call SetHeroLevel(AQD,GetHeroLevel(ZX7),false)
set i=1
loop
exitwhen i>GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'Aamk')
call SelectHeroSkill(AQD,'Aamk')
set i=i+1
endloop
set i=1
loop
exitwhen i>GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A2LL')
call SelectHeroSkill(AQD,'A2LL')
set i=i+1
endloop
set i=1
loop
exitwhen i>GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A2LM')
call SelectHeroSkill(AQD,'A2LM')
set i=i+1
endloop
set i=1
loop
exitwhen i>GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A2M1')
call SelectHeroSkill(AQD,'A2M1')
set i=i+1
endloop
set i=1
loop
exitwhen i>GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A2B4')
call SelectHeroSkill(AQD,'A2B4')
set i=i+1
endloop
set i=1
loop
exitwhen i>GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A2M0')
call SelectHeroSkill(AQD,'A2M0')
set i=i+1
endloop
call UnitRemoveAbility(AQD,'A2M0')
call UnitModifySkillPoints(AQD,-25)
call SuspendHeroXP(AQD,true)
call TriggerRegisterTimerEvent(t,.1,true)
call TriggerRegisterDeathEvent(t,AQD)
call TriggerAddCondition(t,Condition(function ASD))
call SaveUnitHandle(L7,(I97),(2),(ZX7))
call SaveUnitHandle(L7,(I97),(17),(AQD))
call SaveInteger(L7,(I97),(10),(BC7))
call SetUnitState(ZX7,UNIT_STATE_LIFE,GetUnitState(ZX7,UNIT_STATE_LIFE)*(1-(0.-0.*BC7)))
call SetUnitState(ZX7,UNIT_STATE_MANA,GetUnitState(ZX7,UNIT_STATE_MANA)*(1-(0.-0.*BC7)))
call SetUnitState(AQD,UNIT_STATE_LIFE,GetUnitState(ZX7,UNIT_STATE_LIFE))
call SetUnitState(AQD,UNIT_STATE_MANA,GetUnitState(ZX7,UNIT_STATE_MANA))
// call UnitApplyTimedLife(AQD,1112820806,DUR)
call ShuangXiongTime(AQD,DUR)
call SaveUnitHandle(L7,GetHandleId(tt),0,AQD)
call TimerStart(tt,DUR+4,false,function ASD2)
if SuijiMode_HasAghanimState(ZX7) then
if GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A330')>0 then
call XF7(AQD,'A330')
endif
if GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A2Q5')>0 then
call XF7(AQD,'A2Q5')
call XF7(AQD,'A2Q3')
endif
if GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A334')>0 then
call TriggerRegisterUnitEvent(Tri_skill,AQD,EVENT_UNIT_SPELL_EFFECT)
call TriggerRegisterUnitEvent(Tri_skill,AQD,EVENT_UNIT_SPELL_CAST)
call XF7(AQD,'A334')
call XF7(AQD,'A2VW')
endif
if GetUnitAbilityLevel(ZX7,'A333')>0 then
call XF7(AQD,'A332')
call UnitMakeAbilityPermanent(AQD,true,'A14K')
call SetPlayerAbilityAvailable(GetOwningPlayer(ZX7),'A332',false)
call XF7(AQD,'A26A')
call XF7(AQD,'A333')
endif
endif
set ZX7=null
set AQD=null
set t=null
set tt=null
set D88=null
endfunction
