return i1=='H00D' or i1=='Otch' or i1=='N0HP' or i1=='H00U' or i1=='Npbm' or i1=='H001' or i1=='Ucrl' or i1=='Hamg' or i1=='Hlgr' or i1=='U00K' or i1=='O00J' or i1=='Ofar' or i1=='Opgh' or i1=='U00A' or i1=='U00C' or i1=='Udea' or i1=='NC00' or i1=='UC91' or i1=='E002' or i1=='Huth' or i1=='U006' or i1=='U000' or i1=='EC57' or i1=='EC77' or i1=='N00B' or i1=='H004' or i1=='UC60' or i1=='Hmkg' or i1=='E00P' or i1=='H00N' or i1=='UC76' or i1=='UC18' or i1=='Uktl' or i1=='Ulic' or i1=='U00E' or i1=='E01C'
endfunction
